# act config for local CI iteration; see docs/agents/ci-local.md.
# Medium-size runner image: closest free match to GitHub's ubuntu-latest
# without the multi-GB "full" variant; multi-arch, so Docker pulls the
# arm64 build natively on Apple Silicon hosts (no QEMU tax).
-P ubuntu-latest=catthehacker/ubuntu:act-latest
# CI jobs use the pinned 24.04 label; map it to the same local runner.
-P ubuntu-24.04=catthehacker/ubuntu:act-latest
# Reuse the already-pulled image across iteration runs; drop this flag
# (or pass --pull on the command line) to refresh it.
--pull=false
